Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For centuries, the enigmatic truth behind Kaito is a lonely 17-year-old boy who discovers that he can stop time for ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One rainy evening, he uses this power to save Yuna, a girl from his school, from a fatal accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But after saving her, he discovers something terrifying: every time he stops time, someone loses a memory of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Initially, Kaito believes this is a small price to pay for helping others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, as he continues using his ability to protect Yuna from mysterious accidents, his closest friends gradually forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, even his own family begins treating him like a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuna is the only person who remembers him, and she becomes determined to discover why this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While investigating the strange clock-shaped mark on Kaito's wrist, they uncover the existence of the Eternal Clock, an ancient force that controls time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:01:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito's ability is connected to a fracture in reality, and every use of his power makes that fracture worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they can understand the full truth, a mysterious man named Ren attacks them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims that Kaito's power will eventually destroy the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ren offers to remove Kaito's ability, but doing so would erase every memory and connection Kaito has ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito refuses to surrender because he believes he can still control his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ren then reveals that he has already witnessed the destruction of the city in another timeline, and Kaito's repeated attempts to save people are bringing that future closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As time begins breaking apart around them, Kaito and Yuna escape through the collapsing city while Ren pursues them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time Kaito stops time to save Yuna, he loses another precious memory: his childhood, his home, and eventually the moment he first met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuna realizes that Kaito is slowly forgetting the very person he is trying to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She begs him to stop using his power, but Kaito knows that if he does nothing, thousands of people will die when the timeline collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They finally reach the Eternal Clock at the center of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ren confronts them and reveals his true motivation: he once tried to save someone he loved by changing the past, but his actions destroyed his own timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he wants to erase time entirely so nobody will ever suffer loss again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito understands Ren's pain but refuses to let grief destroy everyone's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A final battle begins as the clock tower collapses and reality fractures around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito uses his remaining power to protect Yuna and stop Ren from destroying the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,During the battle, Kaito discovers that he can permanently stop the collapsing timeline, but the cost is that he will disappear from the world's memories and records.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuna begs him to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito searches his fading memories and realizes that, even though he can no longer remember her face clearly, he still knows he wants her to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He stops time one final time.
